      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T19:42:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While I\u0027m all for optimizing the DAG approach, do we have options to improve this case? Isn\u0027t this what `TagCache.updateFastForward()` is supposed to handle?",
      "revId": "9b161f67354db541c66e4d644d190716a5b64392",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b1c11937_d1ae5b2e",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
