      "writtenOn": "2026-10-29T07:16:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks, that\u0027s a good idea for cutting the hops in cached lookups, and it fits with keeping the decorated DAG as the updatable layer. I\u0027ll keep it in mind for the follow-up on lookup time and size.",
      "parentUuid": "b42ad555_12c9e44c",
      "revId": "9b161f67354db541c66e4d644d190716a5b64392",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
