      "writtenOn": "2026-10-29T07:16:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed, I\u0027ll make it configurable: `cache.git_tags.implementation` (`bitmap` or `dag`), with `bitmap` as the default, so nothing changes for sites that don\u0027t opt in. The two implementations persist to separate caches, so switching never reads entries the other one wrote and needs no version juggling. This keeps the RoaringBitmap version, so I\u0027ll abandon the dependency removal (651104) for now. I\u0027ll still work on memory and cached lookup times for the DAG, so that it can become the default later.",
      "parentUuid": "764f550e_e9de18bb",
      "revId": "9b161f67354db541c66e4d644d190716a5b64392",
